Output demo/seg/1.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1180
Set Height 560
Set Padding 26
Set LineHeight 1.25
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 20

Hide
Type "export AGENT_HOST=macmini AGENTRUN_DIR=/tmp/demoreg AGENTRUN_NO_ADOPT=1"
Enter
Type "export PATH=$HOME/Documents/agentview/bin:$PATH; clear"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "mini"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 1800ms
Up
Sleep 2200ms
Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
